    { q: 'Do you work with existing products or only new ones?', a: 'Both. We do redesigns, UX audits, and incremental improvements on existing products just as often as greenfield projects.' },
    { q: 'What tools do you use?', a: 'Figma is our primary tool for UI/UX. We also use Maze and Hotjar for research, and Zeroheight for design system documentation.' },
    { q: 'Can you design and develop?', a: 'Yes. Our design and development teams work together, so you can commission the full stack from us with zero translation loss.' },
  ]}
  related={[
    { slug: 'app-development', label: 'App Development', icon: '📱' },
